        "original_id": "6ed0ad90-ff45-5f5c-92cd-c4f177393002",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Sugar Ray, Against the Current\n- Albums: In the Pursuit of Leisure, In Our Bones\n- Songs: Fly\n- Places: Poughkeepsie, New York\n- Genres: funk metal, pop rock\n\nFacts:\n- Sugar Ray started as more of a funk metal band.\n- Sugar Ray gained mainstream fame in 1997 with the release of the song \"Fly.\"\n- Against the Current is an American pop rock band based in Poughkeepsie, New York.\n- Against the Current formed in 2011.\n- In the Pursuit of Leisure is Sugar Ray's fifth studio album, and it was released in 2003.\n- In Our Bones is the debut studio album by Against the Current.",
